        <li>Section Participants: Non-Society members who are graduate or undergraduate students at The Ohio State University studying and/or interested in the field of Nuclear Science and Engineering are eligible to become Participants. Section Participants may not hold the offices of President or Vice President.</li>
        <li>Collective Reference: Society Members and Section Participants may be referred to collectively as the "membership" for purposes of meeting notifications, event invitations, and general communications.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>3. An active member shall be defined as one who has:</p>
      <ol class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-1">
