      <p>4. Membership Process</p>
      <ol class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Membership does not include a selection process and is active upon request,</li>
        <li>Persons interested in becoming a member should contact the section at <a class="text-primary-600 hover:underline" href="mailto:ENG-ansstudentchapter@osu.edu">ENG-ansstudentchapter@osu.edu</a> or any other forms of interest notification (e.g., direct message on social medias) by presenting their interest in becoming a member of the organization,</li>
        <li>Society membership dues must be paid directly to the American Nuclear Society, with the OSU Student Section selected as the preferred Section affiliation,</li>
        <li>Section Participants are encouraged to pursue Society membership for full benefits and voting rights.</li>
