      <p>6. Member Removal</p>
      <ol class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Members may be removed from the ANS at OSU internal member list organization upon their own request, or the Section may initiate the removal of a member by submitting to the ANS at OSU Board a written petition signed by no fewer than twenty percent (20%) of the Section membership. Causes for removal include, but are not limited to:
