      <p>7. Disciplinary Referral: If a student member of the Section acts in violation of the ANS Respectful Behavior Policy or otherwise in a manner that reflects poorly on the Section/Society, any member can refer that student to a Respectful Behavior Policy Official (RBPO), ANS staff member, or volunteers designated by the Responsible Society Official for review and potential disciplinary action, including possible suspension/termination of membership, or they may submit a written complaint to the Executive Director of the Society.</p>
