    rules: `
      <p>1. Officer Positions and Terms — Including the officers specified in B6.1, the governance structure consists of:</p>
      <ol class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Core Officers (Elected):
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-1">
