            <li>Core Officers (President and Vice President) must be graduate students in the Nuclear Program or conducting nuclear engineering research, or members of the Board of Governors who have at least two years of governing experience, and members of the American Nuclear Society.</li>
            <li>Faculty Advisor must be a Fellow, Member, or Emeritus member of the Society and a faculty member in the Nuclear Engineering Program</li>
          </ol>
