      </ol>
      <p>2. Elections and Eligibility:</p>
      <ol class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Core Officers: Elected by Section membership through secret ballot elections held physically at the host institution, announced at least thirty (30) days in advance by the Communications Officer or Secretary.</li>
        <li>To be considered for these roles, the candidate must be an active member of the section for at least two (2) semesters. The annual election shall be held in September of each year.</li>
        <li>Election Procedures:
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Minimum quorum: not fewer than twenty-five (25) qualified voters, or twenty percent (20%) of membership, whichever is less</li>
